  "description": "'Min Ji-eun', a girl who falls in love easily. The one Ji Eun liked the most was 'Kim Geonwoo', who was in the same class in her first year of middle school and was the most handsome in school. However, when Ji Eun plucked up the courage to confess for the first time in her life, she was rebuffed with a terrible reply: \"Why are you?\".\n\nJi Eun is kicked out of the house for going out without her parents' permission. Ji Eun, who makes her living doing interviews at a cafe, meets her high school crush Kim Gun Woo, who wears a long-skirted maid uniform. This story is about Ji Eun, who has nowhere to go, and Gern Wu, who can't go back.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%81%B4%EB%A1%9C%EB%B2%84-%EC%B9%B4%ED%8E%98-%EB%A9%94%EC%9D%B4%EB%93%9C%EC%94%A8/3435), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61543038)",
